    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Dans ce \u00ab fen\u00eatres sur cour \u00bb qui se d\u00e9roule dans un petit immeuble parisien, tout un monde h\u00e9t\u00e9roclite gravite, s\u2019aime, s\u2019observe sans toujours se voir. C\u2019est l\u00e0 que vit Valentin, jeune homme m\u00e9lancolique, charmant, partag\u00e9 entre sa ma\u00eetresse au temp\u00e9rament insatiable, les trois jeunes filles du cinqui\u00e8me \u00e9tage qui tournent autour de lui, une gardienne d\u00e9monstrative et une belle chinoise dont la pr\u00e9sence dans la maison d\u2019en-face l\u2019intrigue et le fait r\u00eaver. \u00c0 quoi pense-t-il ? Que dissimule-t-il ? Que cherche-t-il ? Valentin invite tous ses voisins \u00e0 sa pendaison de cr\u00e9maill\u00e8re, sans se douter qu\u2019il d\u00e9clenche ainsi une spirale de violences\u2026",
        "english": "In the \"rear window\" that unfolds in a small, Parisian building, a diverse group of people crosses paths, likes and observes each other, without always seeing each other. Valentin lives here. He's a melancholy but charming young man caught between his insatiable mistress, the three young women on the fifth floor who flirt with him, a demonstrative concierge, and a beautiful Chinese woman, whose presence in the building opposite intrigues him. What does he thing about? What is he hiding? What is he looking for? Valentin invites all his neighbor's to his house-warming party, without ever thinking that by doing so he set off a spiral of violent reactions."
    },
